    <briefdescription>
<para>Only find pointer captures which happen before the given instruction. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses the dominator tree to determine whether one instruction is before another. Only support the case where the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value" kindref="compound">Value</ref> is defined in the same basic block as the given instruction and the use. </para>
